# Steam shot 4: level 14 — the black-hole generation, in the thick of it.
# The natural gen-13 field is ~160 rocks, but safe-spawn puts the ship in
# the emptiest pocket — so the mid-frame is packed by hand on top of it,
# with two seekers converging and a comet crossing. Thrust is brief: the
# camera must stay in the dense pocket, not flee into open space.
size 1920 1080
seed 8
sim 1600
game 13
camera fixed
ship 0 -150 35
hold w 1000
hold space 300
blackhole -420 280
asteroid -250 450 tough r=110 v=20,-25
asteroid 300 550 r=85 v=-30,-30
asteroid 550 250 reflective r=95 v=-40,0
asteroid -600 -100 r=75 v=30,10
asteroid 250 -350 quantum r=90 v=-15,25
asteroid 650 -150 r=60 v=-35,15
asteroid -150 700 phasing r=100 v=10,-35
asteroid -450 -550 r=65 v=25,30
asteroid 850 500 r=70 v=-45,-20
hazard seeker 700 300
hazard seeker -650 -350
hazard comet 800 -450 v=-240,80
